% Scenario: two moves. A moveto right after another replaces the
% subpath start, so the stroked path is Move(20,20) Line(30,30) with no
% one-point subpath at (10,10) before it.
10 10 moveto 20 20 moveto 30 30 lineto stroke
showpage
